    "author": "By Chaminda Kuruwita",
    "excerpt": "National Anthem of Srilanka, A Symbol of Unity and Pride The national anthem of Srilanka, “Sri Lanka Matha,” is more than just a song. It is a symbol of unity, pride, and the rich cultural heritage of the island nation. Whether you’re a history buff, a music lover, or a traveler exploring Srilanka, understanding the…",
    "description": "Discover the significance of the National Anthem of Srilanka and its role in cultural heritage and national pride.",
